# VLCKit frameworks (~140 MB of prebuilt binaries) are NOT committed to git.
# `ci_scripts/install_vlckit.sh` downloads + checksum-verifies the pinned build
# into `Frameworks/`; CI runs it automatically via `ci_scripts/ci_post_clone.sh`,
# and it must be run once locally after cloning. Only the license and the
# pinned-version marker (Frameworks/VLCKit-VERSION.txt) are tracked.
*.xcframework/

